rg/wiki/Huopanahkajäkälä","summary":"<b>Huopanahkajälälä</b> (<i>Peltigera canina</i>) on nahkajäkälien sukuun kuuluva jäkälä. Sen yläpinta on vaaleanharmaa ja huopakarvainen. Alapinta on reunoilta valkoinen, mutta keskemmältä tummempi. Liuskat ovat 1–3 senttimetriä leveitä ja niiden reunat ovat alaspäin kääntyneitä. Se voi muodostaa jopa neliömetrien kokoisia toisiinsa sulautuvia kasvustoja. Se on yleinen koko Suomessa sammalten joukossa, kallioilla, kivillä, kuivilla niityillä ja kedoilla.","spread":39082,"m":[0,0,4,2,6,11,19,8,13,11,3,0],"s":[[63.50783,27.59202],[63.01659,27.43006],[63.64745,27.1659],[63.64659,27.20589],[63.36487,27.78789],[63.64493,27.21153],[62.89924,27.6715],[63.64746,27.19572],[63.63201,27.18184],[63.50861,28.10306],[63.64833,27.16889],[63.62257,28.32669],[63.64665,27.16646],[63.64641,27.1717],[62.86611,26.22556]]},{"id":470909,"sci":"Aethalura punctulata","fi":"Pilkkuharmomittari","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4351734/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4351734/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Richard, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC)","wiki":"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aethalura_punctulata","summary":"","spread":39897,"m":[0,0,0,0,14,8,0,0,0,0,0,0],"s":[[63.05652,27.16602],[63.77542,27.34102],[63.6473,27.17081],[63.64734,27.17074],[63.6469,27.17155],[63.64653,27.17247],[63.64789,27.16923],[63.63399,27.16363],[63.63401,27.16358],[63.62524,27.40711],[63.47732,27.43268],[63.90618,27.19136],[63.6465,27.1725],[63.64977,27.18203],[63.65022,27.18363],[63.64722,27.17083],[62.89651,27.82921],[62.69454,26.9658],[62.81622,26.30173]]},{"id":51275,"sci":"Pentatoma rufipes","fi":"Härkälude","group":"Insecta","photo":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/23422672/medium.jpg","photoSmall":"https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/23422672/square.jpg","attribution":"(c) Jon J. Laysell, some rights reserved (CC BY-NC), uploaded by Jon J